invariant: INV-55
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: a record of application data does not end a run of KeyUpdates,
  so the limit counts every KeyUpdate of the session and refuses a peer
  that rekeys between its data. bin/unit reads a full run, a byte of data
  and a second full run.

--- old
        if (pt_len > 0) {
            t->key_update_run = 0;
        }
--- new
